<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2.glbimg.com/PxdpWa7nSjsCDE2tEDLAt7Iawr8=/0x0:2336x1527/1008x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2022/Z/a/XSLKFGQeS4Ah5FYvuOeA/2022-08-17t095622z-423707741-rc27yv99r0iu-rtrmadp-3-pope-audience.jpg" srcset="" alt="Um guarda suíço desmaia durante audiência do Papa Francisco no Vaticano — Foto: REUTERS/Remo Casilli" /></figure>
