<img class=" wp-image-26825" src="https://facebrasil.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/rainha-7-300x169-1.jpg" alt="" width="681" height="384" /> Colar e brincos Delhi Durbar, herdado da Rainha Mary, avó da Rainha Elizabeth II<br />Crédito: REUTERS

