<div class="column medium-22 large-20 medium-centered content-media__container">
<div class="content-media-container glb-skeleton-box">
<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2.glbimg.com/dklGgCyYA1YwNBrGxE73U31W6MA=/0x0:4868x3245/1008x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2022/g/X/9T7zbcSHy1Ja15eLK4xQ/2022-10-17t094455z-1457712071-rc2v2x9otsg3-rtrmadp-3-emirates-precious-diamonds.jpg" srcset="" alt="O diamante Golden Canary, de 303,1 quilates, será leiloado em Nova York, em dezembro. Valor estimado será de US$ 15 milhões. — Foto: REUTERS/Amr Alfiky" /></figure>
